## Sync & Seal (milestone wrap-up)

**Do run** Sync & Seal after **milestone implementation is done**: verification test script, completion report, README updates (+ `package.json` / `swagger.json` / `PROJECT-ORGANIZATION.md` when required). Follow **`docs/workflows/milestone-sync-seal.md`**. Typical trigger: user asked for a milestone plan, you implemented it, then deliver the artifacts in the same milestone thread unless they asked to defer.

**During follow-up tweaks** (small fixes, polish, same milestone already wrapped): **do not** pull in large context from **historical** milestone reports, old test scripts, or README indexes unless debugging something specific. Prefer **minimal edits** to the **current** milestone’s test + report only; avoid rereading or resummarizing the whole `milestone_reports/` tree on every turn.
